{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Day 59 — Capstone project kickoff\n","Objectives:\n","- Define problem statement and success metrics.\n","- Select dataset and draft data pipeline.\n","- Establish baseline model and evaluation plan.\n","Deliverable today: a project skeleton repo and a baseline notebook."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Problem & plan template\n","- Problem: [classification/regression/time series/NLP/vision] on [dataset].\n","- Stakeholder goals and constraints: [...].\n","- Success metrics: e.g., ROC AUC > 0.85 on holdout.\n","- Risks & assumptions: [...].\n","- Milestones: data -> baseline -> improvements -> deployment.\n","\n","## Repository skeleton\n","````\n","capstone/\n","  data/                  # raw/processed (gitignored if large)\n","  notebooks/             # EDA, baseline, experiments\n","  src/                   # reusable modules\n","  models/                # saved artifacts\n","  tests/                 # unit tests\n","  requirements.txt\n","  README.md\n","````\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Baseline notebook checklist\n","- Load and explore data (EDA lite).\n","- Minimal cleaning pipeline.\n","- Baseline model (e.g., logistic regression or random forest).\n","- Evaluate on a holdout set; record metrics.\n","- Log setup with MLflow (optional).\n","\n","## Exercises\n","1) Write your problem statement and success metric in this notebook.\n","2) Create the repo skeleton above.\n","3) Build a baseline and record metrics."]}]}
